# Scorching Dragonfire: "deals 3 damage to target creature or planeswalker. If that creature or planeswalker would die this turn, exile it instead."
# Turn 1: Bot1's own Memnite is a legal target and is exiled, not put into the graveyard. Turn 3: Bot2's Fortress Crab (3/6) survives exactly
# 3 damage (a Mox Jet is no legal target), and the replacement lasts the turn (CR 611.2c), so the Lightning Bolt that then kills the Crab
# exiles it instead of putting it into the graveyard (CR 614.1a).

